{"lyrics":"[00:04.68]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[00:08.42](Hit-Boy)\n[00:08.66]Mm-mm-mm, mm-mm-mm\n[00:10.94]Natural born hustler, nigga, stuntin' is my strong suit\n[00:13.88]Flexin' with a hundred cash, look at what these songs do\n[00:16.80]Gangster and a baller, baby, I do what I want to\n[00:19.78]I be with some steppers, I don't care 'bout what you gon' do\n[00:22.64]Wet shit like the Warriors, all my niggas gon' shoot\n[00:25.58]He gon' have to take a loss, some my niggas gone too\n[00:28.72]I know a bad bitch and I'm who she belong to\n[00:31.50]I just picked a Cuban up from Wafi, bitch, these stones new\n[00:34.36]Dolce & Gabbanas on my feet and these my favorite pair\n[00:37.28]Got a lot to lose, still can't be scared to take it there\n[00:40.30]I was in them slums, shit get dreadful like some Haitian hair\n[00:43.22]I come from that zoo, it's just cobras, pigs, and apes in there\n[00:46.24]1300 block, bitch, I caught my last cases there\n[00:49.04]Ain't no second chances in this shit, so we can't play it fair\n[00:51.92]Foenem line shit like a barber, Glock knock off his facial hair\n[00:54.84]Caught him lackin' in his whip, they tryna find his face in there\n[00:57.76]Lil Hop Out, he stay on go, bitch, all he know is green light\n[01:00.70]Let off shots with accuracy, showed 'em what that beam like\n[01:03.62]Posted by that liquor store, was sellin' what the fiends like\n[01:06.62]Used to wake up in low income, now I live a dream life\n[01:09.48]Natural born hustler, nigga, stuntin' is my strong suit\n[01:12.42]Flexin' with a hundred cash, look at what these songs do\n[01:15.34]Gangster and a baller, baby, I do what I want to\n[01:18.36]I be with some steppers, I don't care 'bout what you gon' do\n[01:21.18]Wet shit like the Warriors, all my niggas gon' shoot\n[01:24.12]He gon' have to take a loss, some my niggas gone too\n[01:27.24]I know a bad bitch and I'm who she belong to\n[01:30.04]I just picked a Cuban up from Wafi, bitch, these stones new\n[01:32.90]Bury me like a pharaoh with this money and my gold too\n[01:35.82]Keep a shooter in there, try to rob me, this the wrong tomb\n[01:38.86]I hit Johnny Dang and mixed the diamonds with the gold tooth\n[01:41.64]The FN sing a song like it's the leader of a soul group\n[01:44.40]Don't come 'round here like we friends, you know I don't know you\n[01:47.58]You know I got demons, allow me to show you\n[01:50.42]Lately, I been on the road (Yeah), show after show\n[01:53.30]I know I'm makin' all the opps mad back home\n[01:55.96]Been a while since I had to dial from a trap phone\n[01:58.84]See you later, alligator, quite a while, crocodile, we gone\n[02:02.54]Pray to God that my money stay long\n[02:04.78]Also prayin' for good aim for when the devil try to go\n[02:08.00]Natural born hustler, nigga, stuntin' is my strong suit\n[02:10.96]Flexin' with a hundred cash, look at what these songs do\n[02:13.88]Gangster and a baller, baby, I do what I want to\n[02:16.86]I be with some steppers, I don't care 'bout what you gon' do\n[02:19.72]Wet shit like the Warriors, all my niggas gon' shoot\n[02:22.66]He gon' have to take a loss, some my niggas gone too\n[02:25.78]I know a bad bitch and I'm who she belong to\n[02:28.58]I just picked a Cuban up from Wafi, bitch, these stones new","words":[[4.68,8.08,"Mm-mm-mm,"],[8.16,8.38,"mm-mm-mm"],[8.42,8.58,"(Hit-Boy)"],[8.66,10.02,"Mm-mm-mm,"],[10.6,10.9,"mm-mm-mm"],[10.94,11.24,"Natural"],[11.3,11.5,"born"],[11.66,11.96,"hustler,"],[12.04,12.24,"nigga,"],[12.3,12.7,"stuntin'"],[12.74,12.82,"is"],[12.9,12.92,"my"],[13.06,13.36,"strong"],[13.48,13.64,"suit"],[13.88,14.18,"Flexin'"],[14.24,14.34,"with"],[14.42,14.42,"a"],[14.6,14.84,"hundred"],[14.9,15.3,"cash,"],[15.38,15.5,"look"],[15.56,15.6,"at"],[15.64,15.76,"what"],[15.82,15.98,"these"],[16.02,16.36,"songs"],[16.44,16.48,"do"],[16.8,17.16,"Gangster"],[17.2,17.26,"and"],[17.36,17.36,"a"],[17.5,17.8,"baller,"],[17.88,18.16,"baby,"],[18.22,18.22,"I"],[18.44,18.5,"do"],[18.6,18.76,"what"],[18.82,